  "Correct Answer": "D",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "ASA requires two angles and their included side. Given \\(\\angle A=\\angle D\\) and the included sides \\(AB=DE\\), the other pair of angles, \\(\\angle B=\\angle E\\), is also needed. The condition \\(\\angle C=\\angle F\\) corresponds to AAS.",
